622
01:24:50,560 --> 01:24:56,240
[SPEAKER_00] Poznato mi je jel to onaj gospodin što je što s psom Giant.

623
01:24:56,480 --> 01:24:56,800
[SPEAKER_01] Da.

624
01:24:57,200 --> 01:24:58,800
[SPEAKER_01] Ali sad sam preporučeno.

625
01:24:59,680 --> 01:25:00,720
[SPEAKER_00] Ne znam, ne znam.

626
01:25:02,480 --> 01:25:05,520
[SPEAKER_01] Dajmund Kave, pitanje za luku.

627
01:25:05,680 --> 01:25:13,680
[SPEAKER_01] Interesuje me ishrana bicikliste tokom breveta, vožnja 8 i po sati koliko različitih vrsta izvora ugljikrata se može koristiti.

628
01:25:13,840 --> 01:25:19,360
