639
01:26:22,800 --> 01:26:24,160
[SPEAKER_00] Da ali ne može.

640
01:26:24,720 --> 01:26:25,360
[SPEAKER_00] Ne može.

641
01:26:25,680 --> 01:26:30,320
[SPEAKER_00] Tako da ovaj može kombinirati više izvora.

642
01:26:30,400 --> 01:26:42,480
