686
01:31:37,280 --> 01:31:42,560
[SPEAKER_00] Znači kofein, pilule, kava, red bull može, alajmo nekako u prvom dijelu dana.

687
01:31:42,880 --> 01:31:46,160
[SPEAKER_00] Količine 3 do 6 mg po kilo.

688
01:31:46,640 --> 01:31:49,040
