705
01:33:51,680 --> 01:34:13,680
[SPEAKER_00] Ako imaš plan training koji uključuje nekakve redovne intervale whatever trainer petalan in definitivno ruha gore tuje i palacore parano sorra bicarbona, ali znajdotni bicarbonati, famozi ozbiljni gastro problemy s tim da dobiješ onako izražene problem.

706
01:34:14,160 --> 01:34:21,200
[SPEAKER_00] More si video Marten, Big Carb system, isto neki pro timovi to uzimaju, a to jako scopo.

707
01:34:26,400 --> 01:34:37,120
[SPEAKER_00] Definitive co fain, betalanine, može se probat creatini, ne billet two i tam eto malo obogatit prehranicle ako im nean.

708
01:34:37,360 --> 01:34:40,000
[SPEAKER_00] Ako im je gotan, name gaat.

709
01:34:40,240 --> 01:34:42,160
[SPEAKER_01] So ciklasi, znači rekao prije.

710
01:34:43,040 --> 01:34:43,760
[SPEAKER_00] Spa dan prije.

711
01:34:48,080 --> 01:34:56,400
[SPEAKER_00] Soca cikle dnevno kroz 3-4 daven danas prije nekog mainta bitna utrke orininga.

712
01:34:56,480 --> 01:35:03,120
